              "briefTitle": "A Comparative Study Between Foraseq and Formoterol/Budesonide Inhalation Capsules in Patients with Asthma",
              "officialTitle": "A Phase III, Randomized, Open-Label, Non-Inferiority Comparative Study Between Foraseq Inhalation Capsules 12/200 \u039cg and Formoterol/ Budesonide Inhalation Capsules 12/200 \u039cg Eurofarma in Patients with Asthma",
